# This repository is local only. It holds a real profile, a real application
# tracker and real generated documents, so it has no remote and should not get
# one. The sanitised public mirror lives in a separate directory.

# Reinstallable: npm install
src/node_modules/

# Generated every run. The tracker is the exception -- it is the one file here
# you edit by hand, and its history is worth having.
output/*
!output/application_tracker.csv

# Written nightly, pruned after 30 days
logs/

# Timestamped backups written by the tools before they overwrite anything.
# Useful on disk, noise in history.
profile/master_profile.????????-??????.json
profile/master.????????-??????.md
config/general_resume_keep.????????-??????.json
output/application_tracker.NEW.csv

# Derived caches. Deleting them costs a rebuild, nothing more.
profile/.bullets.json
profile/.interview_state.json
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Half-written files from an interrupted save
*.tmp
*.md.tmp

# Stray manual copies
*- Copy.*
